        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions WST100SMTSBR, Modern Brass Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 1 Inch Diameter Brass Wasatch Pull is available in a huge selection of finishes including satin brass, oil rubbed bronze, and polished chrome. This modern door pull is a great piece for almost any space. It can be surface mounted, thru-bolt mounted, or back-to-back mounted so it can be used as a front door pull, a shower door handle, or even as a refrigerator handle. Choose from 12 inch, 24 inch, or 36 inch lengths. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available <a href=\"/products/1-inch-diameter-stainless-wasatch-pull-first-impressions-wst100smtss4\"><b>Wasatch Pull in Stainless Steel</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the First Impressions WST100SMTSBR 1\" Diameter Brass Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Material: Brass Tubing</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-WST04-specifications.pdf?v=1704262331\"><b>First Impressions WST100SMTSBR Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>WST100012SMTSBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>WST100024SMTSBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>WST100036SMTSBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 36\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This door handle is handmade in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including <b>Other Lengths</b>. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Cancelable or Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "1 Inch Diameter Brass Wasatch Pull",
                "description": "The 1 Inch Diameter Brass Wasatch Pull is available in a huge selection of finishes including satin brass, oil rubbed bronze, and polished chrome. This modern door pull is a great piece for almost any space. It can be surface mounted, thru-bolt mounted, or back-to-back mounted so it can be used as a front door pull, a shower door handle, or even as a refrigerator handle. Choose from 12 inch, 24 inch, or 36 inch lengths.",
